+ * into 2 -6 9 -11 11 -9 6 -2. Rows 6 and 7 as the column pass takes them, for columns 0 to 3 and 4 to 7; and what
+ * row 7 then adds to the column pass's odd half, b0 to b3, in the same columns. */
